    <h1>About Me!</h1>
Hello! I am Saket, currently a second year at Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Bengaluru! This is a personal website I made to post all the essays I write.

<ul>
<h2>media that i enjoy:</h2>
<li>jojo's bizarre adventure: <br>if i weren't a fan of anything else, i would be a fan of jojo's. it's amazing. </li>
<li>twin peaks: <br>the most magnificent tv series of all time, nothing comes close to it. well, except maybe the next one on this list...</li>
<li>columbo: <br>i love columbo so much! excellent and creative writing in a detective media, and that's saying something.</li>
<li>persona 4: <br> this website was heavily inspired by the particular vibe that persona 4 gives off. it's a great aesthetic and really hits you in the feels.</li>
</ul>

<ul>
    <h2>things i'm working on:</h2>
<li>site refactoring: <br> If you look at the source code of this website (it's actually public, you can check it out <a href = "https://github.com/kanhanimbus/kanhanimbus.github.io">here</a>), you can see that it is a MESS. my main goal for the site is to refactor the code so that it is optimised and clean (along with adding a few more trinkets along the way ;) ).</li>
<li>graphics programming: <br>graphics programming is really cool! engines are really cool! so i'm gonna learn some basics of this stuff. i'll be posting logs on this every once in a while, so be sure to check in!</li>
<li>japanese n2: <br>i'm learning japanese, and i'm trying to learn enough so that i can write the n2 level of jlpt.</li>
<li>game dev: <br>i'm going to learn some of the basics of godot and blender so that i can create my ideas.</li>
<li>the trackendar: <br>a hybrid tracker and calendar. a lot of the times, it becomes hard for students to track all the upcoming quizzes and assignments to submit, so i thought up a concept for an app that makes it substantially easier for students. this one is still in the thought experiment stage, so stay tuned for more updates!</li>
</ul>

